{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip your characters, and organize their inventory as efficiently as possible to make them more and more powerful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783460/extras/titulo-1.png?t=1744908426\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Grid Warriors: Battles, your characters' traits are reflected in your inventory grid. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783460/extras/anim-grid-B.gif?t=1744908426\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will have to think carefully about where to place your items, because the traits you place them on will determine their effects. The same item can have different effects depending on where you place it! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783460/extras/anim-items.gif?t=1744908426\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783460/extras/titulo-2.png?t=1744908426\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adding new characters to your party will expand the size of the inventory grid with the traits of the new characters, and you can choose how to link them to previous characters to find synergies between them. An item can use slots from different characters at the same time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783460/extras/grid2.png?t=1744908426\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783460/extras/titulo-3.png?t=1744908426\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After each combat you will be able to continue advancing through the map to improve your build. With each step you take on the map you will have the opportunity to:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Collect ingredients to improve your items or create new ones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Sell them for money to look for the items you really need in the store.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Add new characters to your group (which will also expand your grid).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Get other powerful items that radically change the focus of your build.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How far will you get?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783460/extras/titulo-wish.png?t=1744908426\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2783460?t=1744908426","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2783460?t=1744908426","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783460/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744908426","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783460/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744908426","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2919350,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip your characters, and organize their inventory as efficiently as possible to make them more and more powerful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783460